WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
stupid bear

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:02,320
So brave

3
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:07,670
It's the first time I heard a ghost dare to call me that. It's impossible.

4
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:10,110
I am a dignified third-level S-level ghost king.

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,500
So what about the third S-level ghost king?

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,500
do it with me

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,300
You are not qualified enough to be a big bear.

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,660
This is our new owner

9
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,860
Pay attention to neighborly unity

10
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,460
It turned out to be the new owner

11
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,460
Forget it this time

12
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:25,080
Pay attention to the short ribs next time

13
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,800
Do you still want to become a ghost?

14
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,120
I suddenly figured it out

15
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,560
Actually, being ordinary is not a bad thing at all.

16
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,960
I think the room you just arranged for me

17
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,240
Very warm
